    wp_ch2_s2_t2_t4: "Illiquid Computing Power Assets:",
    wp_ch5_s1_2_formula: "Bonus Formula: B = 1 + min(S/10000, 0.5)",
    wp_ch6_s1_p2: "Six tokens respectively assume the functions of value anchor, computing power gain, network fuel, asset mapping, profit distribution, and cross-chain hub, forming a closed-loop economic system that mutually supports, constrains, and promotes each other.",
    wp_ch6_s1_p3: "Fluctuations in a single token will not cause systemic impact on the entire ecosystem. Different tokens achieve automatic exchange, automatic burning, automatic staking, and automatic distribution through smart contracts, improving overall economic resilience.",
    wp_ch6_s1_p4: "From a design logic perspective, the six tokens follow a three-layer structure of \"Underlying Support — Mid-layer Incentive — Upper-layer Application\". NEO as the underlying core token assumes ecological value anchoring and basic circulation functions; NEX, NET, NEA form the mid-layer support system, respectively achieving computing acceleration, network consumption, and asset mapping; NRY and NCL form upper-layer application extensions, achieving profit distribution and cross-chain value output.",
    wp_ch6_s1_p5: "The three-layer structure interacts with each other, ensuring the ecosystem possesses self-regulation capabilities during expansion, stabilization, and adjustment periods. The overall token system follows the macro principles of \"controllable production, orderly circulation, continuous consumption, deflationary stability\".",
    wp_ch6_s1_p6: "The core token NEO has a fixed total supply, while other functional tokens set dynamic or semi-dynamic totals according to ecological needs, controlling circulating supply scale through burning mechanisms, staking lockups, and computing power consumption. All token issuance, allocation, transfer, burning, and destruction are executed publicly on-chain, allowing anyone to query in real-time through blockchain browsers, ensuring transparent and trustworthy economic models.",
    wp_ch6_s2_d1: "Mining Output: 30% (300,000,000 tokens), 8-year linear decay release",
    wp_ch6_s2_d2: "Ecosystem Construction: 20% (200,000,000 tokens), quarterly unlocking",
    wp_ch6_s2_d3: "Team Incentives: 15% (150,000,000 tokens), 2-year lockup, released over 12 quarters",
    wp_ch6_s2_d4: "Institutional Investment: 15% (150,000,000 tokens), 1-year lockup, released over 8 quarters",
    wp_ch6_s2_d5: "Community Airdrop: 10% (100,000,000 tokens), phased distribution",
    wp_ch6_s2_d6: "Liquidity: 10% (100,000,000 tokens), gradual release after 6-month lockup",
    wp_ch6_s2_formula: "NEO Mining Reward Formula: R_NEO = (P_eff × K_energy × K_stake × K_time × D_current) / R_total",
    wp_ch6_s2_p2: "NEO adopts fixed total issuance without unlimited minting, ensuring long-term value scarcity support. All outputs are distributed to real participants through mining, node contributions, and ecological incentives, avoiding value monopoly caused by pre-mining and concentrated holdings.",
    wp_ch6_s3_d1: "High-performance Node Mining: 40%",
