    wp_ch6_s8_title: "6.8 Token Circulation Closed Loop",
    wp_ch7_s2_p1: "Mining farms, power stations, and IDC data centers can connect computing power to the ecosystem, issue NEA to achieve asset securitization and financing, improving capital efficiency and asset liquidity.",
